p4405override/override_other_error_cgen.sft.cpp:fn:-DTEST_NUMBER=1 --contracts_p3097 --contracts_p4405 --contract_evaluation_semantic=ignore --contract_analysis_semantic=prove:REQUIREMENTS NOT MET:contracts: P4405 virtual functions with the C-generating back end, after an unrelated error in the translation unit (our GCC's rule since GCC-947): the override obligations of each definition that would have been put out are diagnosed -- a definition that is not inline; an inline one whose class's virtual function table is defined here (its decider function defined here, or none and a constructor defined here); a member of a class template instance constructed here -- and not those of an inline overrider whose virtual function table is defined elsewhere, or of a class nothing here constructs (DECISIONS.md E150).  Mirror: gnu_gcc g++.dg/contracts/cpp26/p4405-override-after-error.C
